MACRO PREF                                                                      
   &PREF.JUST-W6H713                                 W    30 A                  
*                                 KVALITET                                      
*                                 KONTROLLRAPPORT - JUSTERING                   
*                                 NYCKEL KDSEGKEY = 1                           
     &PREF.JUST-KDSEGKEY &PREF.JUST-W6H713                 1 A                  
*                                 TEKNISK SEGMENT-NYCKEL                        
*                                 TECHNICAL SEGMENT KEY                         
     &PREF.JUST-KDKRJUST &PREF.JUST-W6H713                 1 A                  
*                                 JUSTERINGSKOD                                 
*                                 ADJUSTMENT CODE                               
     &PREF.JUST-KDKRSTA &PREF.JUST-W6H713           +2     1 A                  
*                                 KONTROLLRAPPORT STATUS                        
*                                 INSPECTION REPORT STATUS                      
     &PREF.JUST-KVARBTID &PREF.JUST-W6H713          +3     2 P  1               
*                                 ANTAL MANTIMMAR                               
*                                 NUMBER OF MAN HOURS                           
     &PREF.JUST-KVART-RET &PREF.JUST-W6H713         +5     4 P  0               
*                                 ANTAL ARTIKLAR I RETUR                        
*                                 QUANTITY INSPECTED PARTS                      
     &PREF.JUST-KVART-SJUST &PREF.JUST-W6H713       +9     4 P  0               
*                                 ANTAL SALDOJUSTERADE ARTIKLAR                 
*                                 QUANTITY INSPECTED PARTS                      
     &PREF.JUST-KVART-SKROT &PREF.JUST-W6H713      +13     4 P  0               
*                                 ANTAL SKROTADE ARTIKLAR                       
*                                 QUANTITY INSPECTED PARTS                      
     &PREF.JUST-SUMAT &PREF.JUST-W6H713            +17     5 P  2               
*                                 MATERIALKOSTNAD                               
     &PREF.JUST-SUOMK &PREF.JUST-W6H713            +22     4 P  0               
*                                 BELOPP SOM SKALL DEBITERAS                    
*                                 KUND                                          
*                                 AMOUNT TO BE PAID BY CUSTOMER                 
     &PREF.JUST-TIREGDAT &PREF.JUST-W6H713         +26     4 P  0               
*                                 REGISTRERINGSDATUM (≈≈MMDD)                   
*                                 REGISTRATION DATE (YYMMDD)                    
*** END COPY W6H713                  LENGTH =       30                          
